## Not yet checked in the game {% #live-check %}

Both tabs send requests taken from another bot's code, not from our own capture:

- The resource read before a donation and the alliance donation itself. Check one donation on a spare account.
- The Colossus donation. Check one small donation during a Colossus event.
- Which event id is the Colossus. The bot trusts the game's refusal instead. If the id is wrong, the bot can start giving up to 6 hours after the event starts.

## Related errors {% #errors %}

- [PLUGIN_OPTION_CASTLE](/errors/#plugin-option-castle): a row names a castle that isn't on this account.
- [PLUGIN_OPTION_ROW](/errors/#plugin-option-row): a row is not complete.
- [PLUGIN_OPTION_RANGE](/errors/#plugin-option-range): a share of storage is outside 0 to 100.
